<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>body{font-family:DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#17212d}h1{font-size:23px;color:#143586}h2{margin-top:26px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}th,td{text-align:left;padding:8px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid #dce2e8}.amount{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}th{font-size:9px;color:#536171}tr{page-break-inside:avoid}thead{display:table-header-group}.muted{color:#536171}</style></head><body><p class="muted">MiConvener · Personal records</p><h1>Contributions statement</h1><p>{{ $from }} to {{ $to }} · Dates use each organisation’s local timezone.</p>@if($rows->where('undated_amount','>',0)->isNotEmpty())<p><strong>Reconciliation needed:</strong> some historic refunds have no recorded refund date. They appear as undated notes and are excluded from dated net totals below.</p>@endif<p>Voluntary contributions and subsequent dated adjustments. There is no amount owed for giving. Dues are separate.</p>@forelse($rows->groupBy('currency') as $currency=>$items)<h2>{{ $currency }}</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Organisation / fund</th><th>Record</th><th class="amount">Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody>@foreach($items as $item)<tr><td>{{ $item['date'] }}</td><td>{{ $item['organisation'] }}<br>{{ $item['fund'] }}</td><td>{{ str_replace('_',' ',$item['kind']) }}@if($item['undated_amount'] > 0)<br>Refund: {{ $item['currency'] }} {{ number_format($item['undated_amount']/100,2) }} · date not recorded@endif@if($item['member_name'])<br>For {{ $item['member_name'] }} ({{ $item['access_role'] }})@endif</td><td class="amount">{{ number_format($item['amount']/100,2) }}</td></tr>@endforeach<tr><td colspan="3">Net recorded in this period (dated entries)</td><td class="amount">{{ number_format($items->sum('amount')/100,2) }}</td></tr></tbody></table>@empty<p>No contributions or dated adjustments in this period.</p>@endforelse<p class="muted">This is a personal record, not a tax deduction certificate. Keep it private.